      ],
      "explanation": "The overall plan contained responsible owners, timing, materials, medication steps, and emergency thresholds, and the family demonstrated understanding. But the doctor authored a mistaken “two weeks” timing statement for high-risk obstetric follow-up; even though later corrected, this is a minor/moderate responsibility-chain execution error under the frozen rubric.",
